# CYME ShuntCapacitor -> LinearShuntCompensator (both fixed, one section).
# nomQ = total kVAr. nomU for the three-phase bank is line-to-line 4.16 kV: CYME gives
# RatedVoltageKVLN 2.40178 kV per unit, and 2.40178 x sqrt(3) = 4.16 kV. The 611 unit is
# single-phase, so its nomU is the unit's own 2.40178 kV across the unit.
# bPerSection = nomQ / nomU^2 (total for the bank, siemens).

Profile = cim18v17

Table LinearShuntCompensator: mRID, name, node, phases, phaseConnection, grounded, nomQ (kVAr), nomU (kV), bPerSection (S), sections, normalSections, maximumSections, BaseVoltage, EquipmentContainer=fdr_650
